## Realistic Barium-133 generator configuration using IonGenerator
## Generates Ba-133 ions which decay with realistic cascade branching ratios
## Uses Geant4's built-in radioactive decay database (ENSDF data)

# Ion Generator settings for Ba-133
/Generator/IonGenerator/atomic_number 56
/Generator/IonGenerator/mass_number 133
/Generator/IonGenerator/energy_level 0 MeV
/Generator/IonGenerator/decay_at_time_zero true
/Generator/IonGenerator/region INSIDE_CIGAR

# Geometry configuration  
/Geometry/Cigar/pressure 5.5 bar
/Geometry/Cigar/fiber_diameter 1 mm
/Geometry/Cigar/coating TPB
/Geometry/Cigar/fiber_type Y11
/Geometry/Cigar/gas Xe

# Verbosity settings
/run/verbose 1
/event/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/process/em/verbose 0

# Tracking configuration - FORCE ALL TRAJECTORIES TO BE STORED
#/tracking/storeTrajectory 2

### JOB CONTROL
/nexus/random_seed            1
/nexus/persistency/start_id   0
/nexus/persistency/output_file IonBa133_Xe_5.5bar.next

### PERSISTENCY CONFIGURATION - Ensure all particles are saved
#/nexus/persistency/save_particles true
